"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Places often have "
"different names in different languages. The label on the map can show the "
"name in the user's language. Alternatively it can display the name in the "
"official language and glyphs of that place. </p></body></html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
"\">\n"
"p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\n"
"</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'Sans Serif'; font-size:9pt; font-"
"weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Lugares que habitualmente "
"teñen diferentes nomes en distintas linguas. A etiqueta no mapa pode mostrar "
"o nome do lugar na lingua nativa do usuario. Tamén, pode mostrar o nome na "
"lingua oficial e co alfabeto do lugar.</p></body></html>"

#. i18n: file: src/lib/MarbleViewSettingsWidget.ui:279
